flowchart TB
  subgraph MOBILE[Native Android app]
    direction LR
    UI[Jetpack Compose workspaces<br/>Analyzer · Strategies · Calendar · Bot · Risk · Settings]
    CORE[Deterministic Kotlin analyzer<br/>signal · validation · RiskEngine]
    DATA[Supported market/news sources<br/>timestamped data or WAIT/UNKNOWN]
    SEC[SecretsManager<br/>encrypted Android preferences when available]
    DERV[Deriv foreground service<br/>separate on-device execution path]
    UI --> CORE
    DATA --> CORE
    UI --> SEC
  end

  subgraph CONTROL[FastAPI bridge — control plane, not a terminal host]
    direction LR
    API[Pairing · app/terminal/worker auth<br/>readiness · commands · news · reconciliation]
    DB[(SQLite state + event ledger<br/>credential fields Fernet-encrypted)]
    API <--> DB
  end

  subgraph WINDOWS[Managed Windows execution host — required by current MT5 path]
    direction LR
    WORKER[Python Windows worker<br/>claims jobs · provisions isolated terminals<br/>supervises process lifecycle]
    TERM[Broker-specific MT5 terminal<br/>account session · manual WebRequest allowlist]
    EA[MQL5 DestinedFX EA<br/>5-second monitoring · safety gates<br/>orders · position/fill reconciliation]
    WORKER -->|launches / supervises| TERM
    TERM -->|loads| EA
  end

  BROKER[MT5 broker]
  NEWS[Calendar / news provider]
  DERIV[Deriv platform]

  UI -->|HTTPS: app bearer · commands · consented enrollment| API
  API -->|HTTPS: state · trade events · readiness · outcomes| UI
  WORKER -->|HTTPS: worker bearer · job claim / lease / status| API
  API -->|HTTPS: provision job and claim response| WORKER
  EA -->|HTTPS: terminal bearer · claim · heartbeat · snapshots · ACKs| API
  API -->|HTTPS: commands · validated news verdict| EA
  EA <-->|MT5 protocol: account · market data · orders · fills · positions| BROKER
  API <-->|provider request / cache| NEWS
  DERV <-->|handset service session| DERIV

  NOTE[Not execution-ready: Render Free storage is ephemeral.<br/>No workerless hosted-EA registration or verified free PC-off MT5 route.<br/>Cloudflare Workers/D1 spike is not deployed and does not host an MT5 terminal.]
  API -.-> NOTE
  WORKER -.-> NOTE

